flowchart TD
    A([STM32: 10ms Timer Tick]) --> B[Generate Dummy Telemetry]
    B --> C[Format into TelemetryFrame_t]
    C --> D[Print to UART Debug]
    C --> E[Load into SPI TX Buffer]
    E --> F[Toggle DATA_READY Pin HIGH]
    F --> G{Wait for Pi SPI Clock}

    H([Pi: Detects Rising Edge IRQ]) --> I[Acknowledge Hardware IRQ]
    I --> J[Schedule Kernel Workqueue]
    J --> K[Pull SPI CS Low & Generate Clock]
    K --> G

    G --> L[SPI Shifts Data to Pi]
    L --> M[Kernel Validates Frame]
    M -- Valid --> N[Push to kfifo Buffer]
    M -- Invalid --> O[Drop Frame & Log Error]
    N --> P[User-space reads /dev/telem0]
